cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use gwtc_analysis in your work, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: software
title: "gwtc_analysis: GWTC analysis tool"
abstract: >-
  gwtc_analysis is a Python package and command-line tool for analysing the
  Gravitational-Wave Transient Catalogs (GWTC-1 to GWTC-5.0) published by the
  LIGO-Virgo-KAGRA collaborations: catalog queries, parameter-estimation
  samples, skymaps and strain data from GWOSC, Zenodo, S3 and Galaxy sources.
  This software is part of the ACME project that has received funding from the
  European Union’s Horizon Europe Research and innovation programme under Grant
  Agreement No 101131928.
